WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.565 --> 00:00:21.718
"Uh I was just Ally stammered.

2
00:00:21.738 --> 00:00:24.380
"This isn't a changing room!"

3
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.582
the woman snapped, stepping into the room.

4
00:00:26.602 --> 00:00:28.023
"This is Dr.

5
00:00:28.063 --> 00:00:29.324
Lloyd's private office.

6
00:00:29.812 --> 00:00:32.893
You should have found somewhere else to get ready for the costume contest."

7
00:00:34.954 --> 00:00:35.995
Ally almost laughed.

8
00:00:36.015 --> 00:00:39.196
"She thinks this is a costume!"

9
00:00:39.636 --> 00:00:40.076
she thought.

10
00:00:40.096 --> 00:00:42.317
"So sorry!"

11
00:00:43.718 --> 00:00:44.898
Ally scurried for the door.

12
00:00:44.918 --> 00:00:46.759
"You'd better hurry."

13
00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:49.080
The woman's voice softened slightly.

14
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:52.422
"I think the costume contest began a few minutes ago."

15
00:00:52.442 --> 00:00:56.523
"Oh, I'm not entering the contest," Ally said.

16
00:00:56.543 --> 00:00:57.964
"Why not?

17
00:00:58.688 --> 00:01:01.571
There's a hundred-dollar prize, and you've got the best costume here."

18
00:01:03.132 --> 00:01:07.275
Before Ally could say anything else, the woman led her out of the office and took her to

19
00:01:07.315 --> 00:01:08.236
the main exhibit hall.

20
00:01:10.498 --> 00:01:15.702
Sure enough, a group of humans in costumes stood onstage while two judges walked around, inspecting them.

21
00:01:15.722 --> 00:01:22.768
"If we put an asteroid sticker on your back, that means you advance to the next round!"

22
00:01:23.189 --> 00:01:24.069
a judge called out.

23
00:01:25.911 --> 00:01:26.892
"Get on up there!"

24
00:01:27.296 --> 00:01:29.557
Dr. Lloyd's assistant gently pushed Ally up.

25
00:01:35.438 --> 00:01:38.059
Ally scooted to the back, behind the other contestants.

26
00:01:39.179 --> 00:01:42.620
She started to sneak off the stage, but one of the judges had spotted her.

27
00:01:45.621 --> 00:01:49.662
"Your costume definitely earns you a spot in the next round!"

28
00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:52.463
The judge slapped an asteroid sticker on her.

29
00:01:54.224 --> 00:01:54.864
Ally gulped.

30
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:58.410
"Now I'll never be able to sneak away," she thought.

31
00:02:01.372 --> 00:02:04.714
Soon the contest was down to Ally and a kid dressed as Martian Man.

32
00:02:08.517 --> 00:02:09.277
Ally shook her head.

33
00:02:10.838 --> 00:02:13.300
She'd been to Mars once on a peace mission with her parents.

34
00:02:14.281 --> 00:02:16.522
And this kid didn't look anything like a real Martian.

35
00:02:16.542 --> 00:02:20.345
"I don't want to be mean," Ally thought.

36
00:02:20.365 --> 00:02:24.648
"But my costume is so much more authentic."

37
00:02:25.416 --> 00:02:29.439
She did a quick dance move to entertain the audience, and several humans clapped and cheered.

38
00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:31.380
Ally grinned.

39
00:02:32.281 --> 00:02:36.464
She hadn't wanted to enter the contest, and she definitely needed to go look for those parts.

40
00:02:37.465 --> 00:02:38.826
But a part of her was having fun.

41
00:02:38.846 --> 00:02:42.208
"This contest is like a fashion show," she thought.

42
00:02:42.228 --> 00:02:45.350
"And I'm definitely going to win that cash prize!"

43
00:02:46.271 --> 00:02:48.712
Everyone was eagerly waiting for the winner to be announced.

44
00:02:49.793 --> 00:02:53.556
As the judges huddled together, talking, Ally looked out at the spectators again.

45
00:02:54.924 --> 00:02:55.104
"Oh no!"

46
00:02:55.124 --> 00:02:56.405
she thought, spotting her friends.

47
00:02:57.425 --> 00:02:58.265
She covered her face.

48
00:02:58.285 --> 00:03:00.246
"What if they recognize me?"

49
00:03:00.967 --> 00:03:02.847
But the only one looking at her was Mateo.

50
00:03:03.488 --> 00:03:04.428
And he didn't even blink.

51
00:03:06.269 --> 00:03:07.829
At last a judge stepped forward.

52
00:03:07.849 --> 00:03:14.672
"We saw a lot of wonderful costumes today, but there's one that truly stands out.

53
00:03:15.313 --> 00:03:23.076
The winner of the Sandville UFO Convention costume contest is A drumroll sounded over the speakers.

54
00:03:24.028 --> 00:03:26.090
Ally stood up taller and fluffed her tentacles.

55
00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:30.092
She wanted to look good and take an Astralian bow when she accepted the prize.

56
00:03:31.573 --> 00:03:35.676
The drumroll ended and the judge said, "Martian Man!"

57
00:03:35.696 --> 00:03:40.059
"What?" Ally felt like she'd been punched.

58
00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.601
Several seconds passed before she understood what had just happened.

59
00:03:44.282 --> 00:03:46.784
She'd lost the alien costume contest!

60
00:03:51.527 --> 00:03:53.864
she thought, stomping offstage.

61
00:03:53.884 --> 00:03:56.765
"Humans are so ignorant about other beings in the universe!"

62
00:03:57.465 --> 00:04:01.786
Ally felt angry, but she had a bigger problem—she had to get back into Dr.

63
00:04:01.826 --> 00:04:02.507
Lloyd's office.

64
00:04:06.668 --> 00:04:07.648
In the gallery Dr.

65
00:04:07.688 --> 00:04:08.688
Lloyd was still talking.

66
00:04:08.708 --> 00:04:15.550
"I've finally achieved a breakthrough in my efforts to communicate with extraterrestrials."

67
00:04:17.451 --> 00:04:20.292
He placed a small black box with a blinking light on the podium.

68
00:04:23.912 --> 00:04:25.893
It was the one Ally had seen in the cabinet.

69
00:04:25.913 --> 00:04:31.076
"My beacons have been sending signals out into space.

70
00:04:31.816 --> 00:04:34.938
They are specially designed to attract aliens to Earth.

71
00:04:35.679 --> 00:04:38.280
And I have proof that my experiment finally worked."

72
00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.782
"What?" Ally stared at the screen in horror as Dr.

73
00:04:41.822 --> 00:04:42.782
Lloyd played a video.

74
00:04:43.183 --> 00:04:45.404
It showed her escape pod approaching Earth.

75
00:04:49.746 --> 00:04:54.610
believe this spaceship landed somewhere in Sandville, and it's still here," Dr.

76
00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:55.310
Lloyd announced.

77
00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:57.732
"And I intend to find it!"

78
00:04:58.593 --> 00:05:00.555
Everyone gasped, including Ally.

79
00:05:00.575 --> 00:05:02.936
"How do the beacons work?"

80
00:05:03.437 --> 00:05:04.057
someone asked.

81
00:05:04.077 --> 00:05:10.883
"Through advanced technology, the beacons send a signal to communicate to the spaceship that there's something here it

82
00:05:10.943 --> 00:05:12.124
needs," Dr.

83
00:05:12.164 --> 00:05:12.865
Lloyd explained.

84
00:05:12.885 --> 00:05:16.127
"It could be food, fuel, or even spare parts.

85
00:05:16.888 --> 00:05:19.930
But of course, that's just a trick to lure the ship here."

86
00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:21.672
"A trick?"

87
00:05:22.204 --> 00:05:23.204
Ally stood, stunned.

88
00:05:23.224 --> 00:05:27.005
"I was tricked into landing on Earth?"

89
00:05:27.426 --> 00:05:27.826
she thought.

90
00:05:29.306 --> 00:05:31.907
Did that mean she wouldn't find any parts or fuel here?

91
00:05:39.249 --> 00:05:43.390
Tears slipped down her cheeks as she ran out of the gallery and retrieved her meld medallion.

92
00:05:45.431 --> 00:05:48.992
She slipped it over her head and was about to leave the museum when she heard a gasp

93
00:05:49.052 --> 00:05:49.532
behind her.
